  "title": "New Era Energy & Digital Announces Agreement for Dismissal of All Claims Against the Company by the State of New Mexico",
  "summary": "New Era Expressly Denies Any Liability Company Remains Focused on Advancing New Era’s AI Data Center Strategy MIDLAND, Texas – May 28, 2026 – New Era Energy Digital, Inc. (Nasdaq: NUAI) (“New Era” or the “Company”), a developer and operator of next-generation digital infrastructure and integrated power assets, today announced a pending agreement that would lead to the complete dismissal of the Company from the State of New Mexico’s lawsuit in the First Judicial District Court for Santa Fe",
